      "description": "Training-type label: hue text on a 15% tint.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-boulder\">Boulder</span> <span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-board\">Board</span> <span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-routes\">Leder</span>",
      "css": ":host{--bg:oklch(0.16 0.018 255);--card:oklch(0.20 0.022 255);--card2:oklch(0.235 0.026 255);--wash:oklch(0.27 0.03 255);--rule:oklch(0.305 0.03 255);--ink:oklch(0.95 0.008 255);--muted:oklch(0.73 0.02 255);--dim:oklch(0.55 0.025 255);--ember:oklch(0.72 0.17 40);--glow:oklch(0.72 0.17 40 / 0.25);--shadow:oklch(0 0 0 / 0.45);--boulder:oklch(0.78 0.14 55);--board:oklch(0.75 0.12 245);--routes:oklch(0.78 0.13 165)} .ds-pill{font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-block;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}.ds-pill-boulder{color:var(--boulder);background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--boulder) 15%,transparent)}.ds-pill-board{color:var(--board);background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--board) 15%,transparent)}.ds-pill-routes{color:var(--routes);background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--routes) 15%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
